7490=Audio Effects are high quality music enhancement effects created by the powerful audio engine in your sound device.
7491=Audio Clean-up enables the removal of unwanted noises like "clicks" and "pops" in a digital audio file or audio from external sources.
7492=Time Scaling allows the user to speed up or slow down music without changing the pitch (for WAV, MP3, Audio CD and VCD).
7493=CMSS 3D creates surround sound effect on your headphone or upmixes stereo music to multi-channel surround sound on a 4.1, 5.1 or 6.1 speaker system. CMSS 2 features added ambient effects and is ideal for listening to DVD movies with Dolby Digital soundtracks.

