10015=No necessary rights available to playback this secure file.
10016=Not enough memory to perform task. Free up memory by closing other applications and try again.
10017=Not enough disk space to perform task. Free up disk space by deleting unwanted files and try again.
10018=Missing CD. Please load the correct CD and try again.
10019=There is not enough disk space at the destination for this transfer.
